The other features (BINDING) refer to Mg(2+) binding, which is not central to the primary reaction of glycerophospholipid flippase activity. Therefore, the ACT_SITE annotation is the most plausible explanation for why Q9LI83 carries the GO term "glycerophospholipid flippase activity."

